{{define "content"}}

<div class="hero">
<img src="/images/about-hero.png" alt="Ice Cream Truck at a Park">
<div class="hero-text">
    <h1>About Us</h1>
    </div>    
</div>

<div class="about-section">
    <h2>Our Story</h2>
    <div class="message-about">
    <p>
    We are a family-owned ice cream truck bringing joy, flavor, and convenience to the Idaho Falls and Rexburg communities. After years of imagining this venture, we finally decided to turn our dream into reality. What began as a simple idea has grown into a meaningful project for our family—one that allows us to work together, build something lasting, and share happiness with the people around us.
    Our goal is to serve neighborhoods, public gatherings, and private events with delicious treats and exceptional service. By blending old-fashioned fun with modern tools like a dedicated website—and eventually a mobile app—we aim to make every customer interaction smooth, enjoyable, and memorable.
    </p>
    </div>
    <img src="/images/family.jpg" alt="Family Running the Ice Cream Truck" class="about-image">

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <div class="message-about">
    <p>Our mission is to deliver high-quality ice cream, reliable service, and unforgettable experiences to people of all ages. We are dedicated to serving both public and private events, offering convenient ways for customers to interact with us through our website and future mobile app. Every detail—from the flavors we serve to the systems we build—is crafted with care, enthusiasm, and family pride. We strive to operate with professionalism, creativity, and heart, ensuring that every scoop brings a smile and every visit leaves a lasting impression.
    </p>
    </div>

    <h2>Our Vision</h2>
    <div class="message-about">
    <p>Our vision is to become a beloved local favorite in the Idaho Falls and Rexburg area—a mobile ice cream experience that brings communities together. We want to create moments of joy, strengthen neighborhood connections, and provide a unique, family-friendly addition to the local food scene. Through quality service, innovative technology, and a commitment to our community, we hope to build a business that reflects who we are and the values we share.
    </p>
</div>
</div>
{{end}}
